In order to work in Ireland a non-EEA National, unless they are exempted, must hold a valid employment permit.  Please review the Eligibility and requirements for an employment permit if you are unsure of your eligibility to apply for this vacancy. <br>  CNC Machinist required to work at Tremora Ltd, trading as ECO Timber Systems, located at Unit 16, Carrigaline Industrial Estate, Carrigaline, Co. Cork, P43 YY24. 

Must have at least 2 years’ experience in a similar role. Duties are: 

1. Setting up, operating and monitoring CNC machinery to produce components to engineering drawings and specifications; 
2. Preparing and loading raw materials into CNC machines;
3. Reading and interpreting technical drawings, plans and machining specifications; 
4. Editing CNC programmes for minor adjustments where required; 
5. Machining components to a high level of precision and tolerance; 
6. Carrying out quality inspections using measuring and inspection equipment and recording results in accordance with company procedures; 
7. Troubleshooting machining issues and making adjustments to maintain production quality; 
8. Performing routine preventative maintenance and reporting equipment faults or defects promptly; 
9. Finishing, labelling and preparing completed parts for the next stage of production; 
10. Ensuring all work is carried out in accordance with health and safety standards and company procedures. 

Salary: €37,544 per annum. 
Hours: 40 per week. 
Apply to Alan

